@startuml
title SD-B27 Mengajukan Permintaan Edit

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
}

actor "Klien" as Klien
boundary "Halaman Project Klien" as HalamanProject
boundary "Form Permintaan Edit" as FormEdit
control "PhotoSelectionController" as PhotoSelectionController
control "NotificationService" as NotificationService
entity "Projects Model" as Project
entity "Bookings Model" as Booking

Klien -> HalamanProject : Membuka riwayat/detail project
HalamanProject -> PhotoSelectionController : show(projectId)
PhotoSelectionController -> Project : ambil project milik klien
Project --> PhotoSelectionController : data project
PhotoSelectionController --> HalamanProject : tampilkan link Drive dan form edit

Klien -> Klien : Membuka link Google Drive foto mentah
Klien -> Klien : foto mentah tampil
Klien -> FormEdit : Mengisi kode foto maksimal 10
Klien -> FormEdit : Mengisi deskripsi edit
Klien -> FormEdit : Kirim permintaan edit
FormEdit -> PhotoSelectionController : submit(projectId, photoCodes, note)
PhotoSelectionController -> Project : ambil data project
Project -> Booking : ambil booking
Booking --> Project : data booking
Project --> PhotoSelectionController : data project/booking
PhotoSelectionController -> PhotoSelectionController : validasi link RAW tersedia
PhotoSelectionController -> PhotoSelectionController : validasi kode foto <= 10
PhotoSelectionController -> PhotoSelectionController : validasi deskripsi edit
PhotoSelectionController -> PhotoSelectionController : validasi belum pernah dikirim dan tidak dibatalkan

alt Data valid
    PhotoSelectionController -> Project : update edit_photo_codes,\nedit_request_note,\nedit_requested_at,\nstatus EDITING
    Project --> PhotoSelectionController : project diperbarui
    PhotoSelectionController -> NotificationService : kirim notifikasi ke editor
    NotificationService --> PhotoSelectionController : notifikasi terkirim
    PhotoSelectionController --> HalamanProject : tampilkan pesan berhasil
    HalamanProject --> Klien : permintaan edit tersimpan
else Kode foto lebih dari 10
    PhotoSelectionController --> FormEdit : tampilkan error maksimal 10 foto
    FormEdit --> Klien : permintaan ditolak
else Deskripsi kosong
    PhotoSelectionController --> FormEdit : minta lengkapi deskripsi
    FormEdit --> Klien : data belum lengkap
else Booking dibatalkan / form sudah pernah dikirim / link belum tersedia
    PhotoSelectionController --> FormEdit : proses tidak dapat dilanjutkan
    FormEdit --> Klien : permintaan edit ditolak
end

@enduml
